        <div class="section-title">1.1 Read it first!</div>
        <p>Before attempting any operation with IED from 620 series, read carefully the IED documentation first.</p>
        <p>This document is addressed to anyone who needs to interact with 620 series and its IEC 61850 features in more detail.</p>

        <div class="section-title">1.2 Document information</div>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 15%;">Revision</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%;">Date</th>
                    <th style="width: 60%;">Note</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for rev in revision_history %}
                <tr>
                    <td>{{ rev.revision }}</td>
                    <td>{{ rev.date }}</td>
                    <td>{{ rev.note }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="section-title">Applicability</div>
        <p>This manual is applicable to all 620 series Protection and Control IED versions mentioned in document Revision History above or newer versions if document update is not required.</p>

        <div class="section-title">2 Safety Information</div>
        <p>There are safety warnings and notes in the following text. They are in a different format to distinguish them from normal text.</p>

        <div style="border: 2px solid red; padding: 15px; margin-top: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center;">
