                <p style="font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">Do not make any changes to the 620 series configuration unless you are familiar with the 620 series and its configuration tool. This might result in disoperation and loss of warranty.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 2px solid orange; padding: 15px; margin-top: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center;">
