            <div>
                <p style="font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">A note contains additional information worth noting in the specific context, and looks like below:</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p>The selection of this control mode requires caution, because operations are allowed both from the HMI and remotely.</p>
    </div>

