                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>
        <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 10px;">c1 – shall be 'm' if support for any service specified for Client/S are declared within the ACSI basic conform-ance statement.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 9pt;">c2 – shall be 'm' if support for any service specified for GOOSE/GSE Management are declared within the ACSI basic conformance statement.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 9pt;">c3 – shall be 'm' if support for any service specified for GSE A-Profile are declared within the ACSI basic conformance statement.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 9pt;">c4 – support for at least one other A-Profile shall be declared (e.g. in A1-A3) in order to claim conformance to IEC 61850-8-1.</p>

